        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "d9b8c576-7243-5102-924b-a2ce9bb61794",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kim Warwick, Jorge Lozano, Wojtek Fibak, Mark Edmondson, Bernard Mitton\n- Events: Australian Open 1978, Australian Open 1980, Australian Open 1981, Australian Open 1985, Roland Garros 1986, 1979 South Australian Open – Singles\n- Topics: Tennis singles titles, tennis doubles titles\n\nFacts:\n- In 1978, Kim Warwick won the Australian Open doubles title with Wojtek Fibak.\n- In 1979, Kim Warwick won the 1979 South Australian Open singles title by defeating Bernard Mitton 7–5, 6–4 in the final.\n- In 1980, Kim Warwick won the Australian Open doubles title with Mark Edmondson.\n- In 1981, Kim Warwick won the Australian Open doubles title with Mark Edmondson.\n- In 1985, Kim Warwick and Mark Edmondson were runners-up in Australian Open doubles.\n- In 1986, Kim Warwick won the Roland Garros doubles title with Mark Edmondson.\n- Kim Warwick won three career singles titles and 26 career doubles titles.\n- Jorge Lozano won nine career doubles titles and no career singles titles.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
