        "text": "Page: Kim Warwick. Sentence: He won three singles titles and 26 doubles, including Australian Open 1978 (with Wojtek Fibak) and Australian Open 1980 and 1981, Roland Garros 1986 and also a runner-up in Australian Open 1985, all of them partnering fellow countryman Mark Edmondson.\nPage: Jorge Lozano. Sentence: In his career, he won nine doubles titles, but no singles titles.\nPage: 1979 South Australian Open – Singles. Sentence: Kim Warwick won the title, defeating Bernard Mitton 7–5, 6–4 in the final.",
